 {:db/id "q-343438" :question/id #uuid "3ea02f42-e1ec-509f-a6b0-19fd2f4064ef" :question/math-academy-id "q-343438" :question/problem "$$\nF(x)={\\begin{aligned}-1, & x\\in [-4,0] \\\\ 3, & x\\in (0,4)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsider the function $F(x)$ shown above. The Fourier series of the $8$-periodic extension $f(x)$ of $F(x)$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼1+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{8}{\\pi (2n-1)}sin\\,(\\frac{(2n-1)\\pi x}{4}).\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.At $x=-2,$ we have\n\n$$\nsin\\,(\\frac{(2n-1)\\pi \\cdot (-2)}{4})={{field-1}}.\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)$ is \n{{field-2}}\nat $x=-2,$ the corresponding Fourier series converges to \n\n$$\nf(-2)={{field-3}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have \n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}}{2n-1}={{field-4}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite our Fourier series as\n\n$$\nf(x)∼1+\\frac{8}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{2n-1}\\cdot sin\\,(\\frac{(2n-1)\\pi x}{4}).\n$$\n\nNow, notice that at $x=-2,$ we have\n\n$$\nsin\\,(\\frac{(2n-1)\\pi \\cdot (-2)}{4})=sin\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{2}-n\\pi )=(-1)^{n}.\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)$ is $\\text{continuous}$ at $x=-2,$ the corresponding Fourier series converges to \n\n$$\nf(-2)=-1.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-2) & =1+\\frac{8}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{2n-1}\\cdot sin\\,(\\frac{(2n-1)\\pi \\cdot (-2)}{4}) \\\\ -1 & =1+\\frac{8}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{2n-1}\\cdot (-1)^{n} \\\\ -2 & =\\frac{8}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n}}{2n-1} \\\\ {\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n}}{2n-1} & =-\\frac{\\pi }{4} \\\\ {\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}}{2n-1} & =\\frac{\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-343438/ma-source-field/451f3bb09661242567177c142f48b1f6d334a27e235d16e593a22e1d534988f4" "q-343438/ma-source-field/a2becfe55f0fb1970523c60177923bc10f2994ac48509d763c91566217fdced8" "q-343438/ma-source-field/d553df43be13376d4956da336208ab716f88e41932d8809f9c537a1a87566b24" "q-343438/ma-source-field/99382a3a84a3692ed9e013be49c95bc32b2a2c12063da266ba05bad5f65cd18f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}
