 {:db/id "q-343446" :question/id #uuid "09760520-d150-5b51-9f43-20d7cea8711d" :question/math-academy-id "q-343446" :question/problem "$$\nF(x)={\\begin{aligned}4, & x\\in [-\\pi ,0] \\\\ -2, & x\\in (0,\\pi )\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsider the function $F(x)$ shown above. The Fourier series of the $2\\pi $-periodic extension $f(x)$ of $F(x)$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼1-{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{12}{\\pi (2n-1)}sin\\,((2n-1)x).\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.At $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2},$ we have\n\n$$\nsin\\,((2n-1)\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2})={{field-1}}.\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)$ is \n{{field-2}}\nat $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2},$ the corresponding Fourier series converges to \n\n$$\nf(\\frac{\\pi }{2})={{field-3}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have \n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}}{2n-1}={{field-4}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite our Fourier series as\n\n$$\nf(x)∼1-\\frac{12}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{2n-1}\\cdot sin\\,((2n-1)x).\n$$\n\nNow, notice that at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2},$ we have\n\n$$\nsin\\,((2n-1)\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2})=sin\\,(-\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi )=(-1)^{n+1}.\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)$ is $\\text{continuous}$ at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2},$ the corresponding Fourier series converges to \n\n$$\nf(\\frac{\\pi }{2})=-2.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(\\frac{\\pi }{2}) & =1-\\frac{12}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{2n-1}\\cdot sin\\,((2n-1)\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2}) \\\\ -2 & =1-\\frac{12}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{2n-1}\\cdot (-1)^{n+1} \\\\ -3 & =-\\frac{12}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}}{2n-1} \\\\ {\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}}{2n-1} & =\\frac{\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-343446/ma-source-field/72f0e5041b76fa9d259b051cc3e73bf2adee6a0bfd79c4c1d87d8c7f111c1d88" "q-343446/ma-source-field/a2becfe55f0fb1970523c60177923bc10f2994ac48509d763c91566217fdced8" "q-343446/ma-source-field/4d12baf9b8023ea3864fed3addcfabce5f0166277e78a31d2c78be749638fbd9" "q-343446/ma-source-field/99382a3a84a3692ed9e013be49c95bc32b2a2c12063da266ba05bad5f65cd18f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}
