 {:db/id "q-35559" :question/id #uuid "cf85bb24-d080-5608-9b8e-8c02ff8974d0" :question/math-academy-id "q-35559" :question/problem "From top to bottom, fill in the blanks and hence complete the proof of the following statement using the axioms $[\\text{A}1]-[\\text{A}8]$ given below.\n\n*Statement: *\n\n*$0x=0$ for any $x\\in V$* \n\n*Proof:*\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0x & =0x &  & [\\,\\text{given}\\,] \\\\ (0+0)x & =0x &  & [\\,\\text{property of number }0\\,] \\\\ 0x+0x & =0x &  & [\\,\\text{axiom __}\\,\\,] \\\\ (0x+0x)+(-0x) & =0x+(-0x) &  & [\\,\\text{add }-0x\\text{ to both sides}\\,] \\\\ (0x+0x)+(-0x) & =0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A4}\\,] \\\\ 0x+(0x+(-0x)) & =0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A2}\\,] \\\\ 0x+0 & =0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A4}\\,] \\\\ 0x & =0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom __}\\,\\,]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThe axioms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{[A1]}:x+y=y+x & \\text{[A5]}:1\\cdot x=x \\\\ \\text{[A2]}:(x+y)+z=x+(y+z) & \\text{[A6]}:\\alpha (\\beta x)=(\\alpha \\beta )x \\\\ \\text{[A3]}:x+0=x & \\text{[A7]}:(\\alpha +\\beta )x=\\alpha x+\\beta x \\\\ \\text{[A4]}:x+(-x)=0 & \\text{[A8]}:\\alpha (x+y)=\\alpha x+\\alpha y\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the vector space axioms, we obtain the following: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0x & =0x &  & [\\,\\text{given}\\,] \\\\ (0+0)x & =0x &  & [\\,\\text{property of number }0\\,] \\\\ 0x+0x & =0x &  & [\\,\\text{axiom }\\text{A7}\\,] \\\\ (0x+0x)+(-0x) & =0x+(-0x) &  & [\\,\\text{add }-0x\\text{ to both sides}\\,] \\\\ (0x+0x)+(-0x) & =0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A4}\\,] \\\\ 0x+(0x+(-0x)) & =0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A2}\\,] \\\\ 0x+0 & =0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A4}\\,] \\\\ 0x & =0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom }\\text{A3}\\,]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-35559/ma-source-field/7560bbf1d950198be0e93331ef782fe4a8ee0b01ec3b14343032e6ff63e02344"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}
